*icc = 10
* DESCRIPTION:   Equation for field at TF coil
* JUSTIFICATION: Turned off, constraint is depreciated
* VARIABLES:     Calculated in-situ

*icc = 38
* DESCRIPTION:   Obsolete constraint
* JUSTIFICATION: Turned off, obsolete constraint 
* VARIABLES: 

*icc = 57-58
* DESCRIPTION:   Obsolete constraint
* JUSTIFICATION: Turned off, obsolete constraint
* VARIABLES:  

